      "page": 24,
      "category": "benefits",
      "text": "Heritance® and \nNewStyle® Benefits\nScan to see more information about \nHeritance® and NewStyle® construction\nSCAN ME\nBENEFITS\nSuperior Quality\nHeritance® and NewStyle® shutters are meticulously crafted with \nTruemill® dovetail construction, for strong panels that stand the test of time.\nOne-Touch Closure\nExclusive SoftClose™ louvers feature one-touch control so louvers \nclose softly and smoothly—and Quick Align™, for easy louver alignment. \nEnergy Efficiency\nClose shutter louvers to keep warm air out when it's hot \nand in when it's cold, reducing energy costs.\nSound Deflection\nClosed louvers deflect outside noise to keep your indoor space calm and quiet. \nUV Protection\nWhen fully closed, Heritance® and NewStyle® shutters protect furniture, \nflooring and artwork from fading. \nHealthier Indoor Air\nHeritance® and NewStyle® Shutters are GREENGUARD® Gold Certified \nfor low indoor chemical emissions.",
