      "page": 25,
      "category": "control",
      "text": "Light Control and Privacy\nDaylighting\nShutters provide energy efficiency by drawing natural light into a room, reducing the need for artificial lighting.\nSplit Tilt\nFor more privacy, choose split tilt with \nindependent upper and lower louver operation.\nDivider Rail\nAdd strength to larger panels with divider rails, \nwhile allowing independent upper and lower \nlouver operation.\nAstragal\nThis feature covers the gap where two panels \nmeet, helping to minimize any light passing \nbetween rabbeted stiles.\n2 ½\" Louver\nIdeal for smaller windows\n3 ½\" Louver\nA pleasing standard louver size\n4 ½\" Louver\nProvides a more expansive view\nLIGHT CONTROL\nAND PRIVACY\nLIGHT CONTROL\nAND PRIVACY",
